   "key": "§ Architecture decision records > 002 — The macOS jobs run at scope `unit`; the full run is on demand",
   "hash": "2b1ba6e30992655a",
   "does": "Claims the no-Xcode script gates run on a Linux runner on every pull request and push to main (gates.yml), the macOS jobs in ci.yml (SwiftLint and budgets, strict concurrency, build, unit suite, Thread Sanitizer) run at scope unit on every pull request and push to main, and the UI target and full coverage floors (scope full) run on demand and before every release; points to CI_POSTURE.md for per-scope cost. Verified: gates.yml and ci.yml trigger on pull_request, push to main and workflow_dispatch; ci.yml's tests job takes scope unit when inputs.scope is empty; workflow_call defaults to full (testflight.yml).",
